WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Why don't you believe it?

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:05,200
85 years under 18 years old

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,400
He is the only child in the village who has been admitted to college

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,000
His father confirmed the baby’s marriage and accepted the gift money

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
He was not allowed to go out to study, so he ran away secretly.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,800
That year he went home for vacation and walked along the riverside path

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,200
I was stopped by the descendant and moved my hands and feet for you.

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,200
I raised my head and passed by to drive you away

9
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,000
I want to take him home and teach him a lesson

10
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,800
Feeling aggrieved, he turned to leave

11
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,800
As I pulled, I became more and more angry.

12
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,200
A mistake pushed him down

13
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:31,380
His head hit a rock and he passed out.

14
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,380
Then what?

15
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:33,580
I'm afraid this will get out

16
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,180
Boss, I can't keep my tight clothes on.

17
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,780
There is no one in private. I used cast head to escape the trap.

18
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:37,980
push him down

19
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,880
Another big stone was moved and placed on my heart

20
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,080
that's your daughter

21
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,580
Her only wish is to go home

22
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,180
Just now she was begging me to cure your eyes

23
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,980
What's the use of having so much knowledge for a child?

24
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,180
In the end, it's not just a waste of money to get married.

25
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,980
Mom, my sister is a living person

26
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:52,680
That's my biological sister. Are you burying her alive?

27
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:54,180
I will report this matter truthfully

28
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,780
At worst, I don’t want this outfit anymore.

29
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,880
You kept it a secret for thirty years, why are you telling me now?

30
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,580
Daxian calculated two things for me

31
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:01,780
The first thing is that my eyes are going blind.

32
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:04,280
The second thing: I will see you again in a few decades

33
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,880
After seeing her, my death is coming

34
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:08,080
If you don't tell it, you won't be able to enter reincarnation even if you die.

35
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,580
She spoke not because of her conscience, but because she was afraid that her words would come true.

36
00:01:10,580 --> 00:01:12,280
Next, let’s take a closer look.

37
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:16,580
I'll send you to the underworld. You can see if you can reincarnate again.

38
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:19,780
When I woke up, my nose was full of dirt and I couldn't breathe.

39
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:21,580
I was suffocated to death

40
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:23,580
I am filial to my parents, respect my elder brother

41
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:25,980
In the end, my mother buried me alive

42
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:28,320
Not good. He turned into a wraith.

43
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:37,750
Under, don't force me

44
00:01:37,750 --> 00:01:39,740
We don't have to catch up with her

45
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:41,540
Yang is so hurt that he will come back

46
00:01:41,540 --> 00:01:42,840
I don’t blame you today

47
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,740
But you should have a long memory in the future

48
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:47,040
When investigating anything, go to the root of it

49
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:49,040
Should I protect him?
